// What a person uses a day (kg), and how long they last with none of it (s), before their own
// resilience, which gives each 1 to 1.2 times as long. They are weak a third of the way there and
// critical two thirds of the way (`weak`, `critical`, shares of `lasts`), and recover as fast as they
// declined once they have it again. `name` is what people call it; `makes`, what each person makes of
// it a day.
//
// People breathe the cabin's air: oxygen and nitrogen at sea-level pressure, which a regulator keeps
// there from the tanks (`keep`, Pa, from `from`), filling an empty cabin in `refill` seconds. What
// they breathe out stays in it, up to `most` (8 kPa of CO2): past that they cannot breathe out, and
// go short of air. A cabin starts full; it is let down through its valve (`vent`, m²) and leaks
// through any hole, both to vacuum. Its air is at `temperature` (K). `room_per_seat` is the cabin
// where a part does not say.
//
// `limits` are what the air has to be for people to be well: a gas's partial pressure (`gas`), or
// the whole pressure, at or above `least` and at or below `most` (Pa). Out of one, people go short
// of it like any need and die after `lasts`, unless their suits are on. Below 6.3 kPa body fluids
// boil (the Armstrong limit); below 10 kPa of oxygen people pass out within the hour; over 2 kPa of
// CO2 they sicken within hours, and die in half a day.
//
// Every cabin is fitted with a LiOH scrubber a seat, and carries the LiOH for the days it carries
// supplies for. Waste water and waste go overboard when there is nowhere to keep them.
[
  {
    id: "realistic",
    name: "Realistic",
    needs: [
      { resource: "CabinOxygen", name: "air", daily: 0.84, lasts: 300, makes: { CO2: 1.0 } },
      { resource: "Water", name: "water", daily: 3.0, lasts: 259200, makes: { WasteWater: 2.5 } }, // 3 days
      { resource: "Food", name: "food", daily: 0.6, lasts: 2592000, makes: { Waste: 0.1 } }, // 30 days
    ],
    air: {
      temperature: 294,
      gases: [
        { resource: "CabinOxygen", name: "oxygen", molar_mass: 0.032, keep: 21000, from: "LqdOxygen" },
        { resource: "CabinNitrogen", name: "nitrogen", molar_mass: 0.028, keep: 80000, from: "Nitrogen" },
        { resource: "CO2", molar_mass: 0.044, most: 8000 },
      ],
      refill: 60,
      vent: 0.001,
    },
    limits: [
      { name: "air pressure", least: 6300, lasts: 90 },
      { name: "oxygen", gas: "CabinOxygen", least: 10000, lasts: 3600 },
      { name: "clean air", gas: "CO2", most: 2000, lasts: 43200 },
    ],
    room_per_seat: 2.0,
    fitted: [{ process: "lioh_scrubber", per_seat: 1 }],
    dump: ["WasteWater", "Waste"],
  },
]
